ondaryAttribute":"What does \"${lm:\/\/Field\/1}\" mean?","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"What does \"${lm:\/\/Field\/1}\" mean?","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q595","QuestionType":"TE","Selector":"SL","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"What does \"${lm:\/\/Field\/1}\" mean?","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID594"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_1U30Tu75n416PxI","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID595","SecondaryAttribute":"How familiar are you with this phrase?","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"How familiar are you with this phrase?","DataExportTag":"Q597","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"How familiar are you with this phrase?","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Extremely familiar"},"2":{"Display":"Very familiar"},"3":{"Display":"Moderately familiar"},"4":{"Display":"Slightly familiar"},"5":{"Display":"Not familiar at all"}},"ChoiceOrder":[1,2,3,4,5],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID595"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_1U30Tu75n416PxI","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID596","SecondaryAttribute":"How easy was it for you to think of what this phrase might mean?","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"How easy was it for you to think of what this phrase might mean?","DataExportTag":"Q599","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"How easy was it for you to think of what this phrase might mean?","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Extremely easy"},"2":{"Display":"Moderately easy"},"3":{"Display":"Slightly easy"},"4":{"Display":"Neither easy nor difficult"},"5":{"Display":"Slightly difficult"},"6":{"Display":"Moderately difficult"},"7":{"Display":"Extremely difficult"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5","6","7"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID596"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_1U30Tu75n416PxI","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID598","SecondaryAttribute":"What does \"${lm:\/\/Field\/1}\" mean?","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"What does \"${lm:\/\/Field\/1}\" mean?","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q599","QuestionType":"TE","Selector":"SL","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"What does \"${lm:\/\/Field\/1}\" mean?","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID598"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_1U30Tu75n416PxI","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID599","SecondaryAttribute":"How familiar are you with this phrase?","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"How familiar are you with this phrase?","DataExportTag":"Q601","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"How familiar are you with this phrase?","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Extremely familiar"},"2":{"Display":"Very familiar"},"3":{"Display":"Moderately familiar"},"4":{"Display":"Slightly familiar"},"5":{"Display":"Not familiar at all"}},"ChoiceOrder":[1,2,3,4,5],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID599"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_1U30Tu75n416PxI","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID600","SecondaryAttribute":"How easy was it for you to think of what this phrase might mean?","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"How easy was it for you to think of what this phrase might mean?","DataExportTag":"Q603","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"How easy was it for you to think of what this phrase might mean?","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Extremely easy"},"2":{"Display":"Moderately easy"},"3":{"Display":"Slightly easy"},"4":{"Display":"Neither easy nor difficult"},"5":{"Display":"Slightly difficult"},"6":{"Display":"Moderately difficult"},"7":{"Display":"Extremely difficult"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5","6","7"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID600"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_1U30Tu75n416PxI","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID601","SecondaryAttribute":"You will be presented, one at a time, with 35 noun-noun phrases which you may or may not have see...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: transparent;\">You will be presented, one at a time, with 35 noun-noun phrases which you may or may not have seen in print or heard someone say. Pretend you had just heard the phrase in conversation and think of what the person meant by it. Once you think of a meaning, please type it in the box below the phrase. Try to think of a meaning as quickly as you can. You do not have to provide an overly detailed meaning, but the meaning should also not be vague.<\/span>\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div><div><div>One way in which people combine individual words into full-fledged concepts is by a specific type of relation between the two words. For example:<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>1. The concept \"ant apple\" means &nbsp;\"Apple with ants on it\", and not \"A small apple\".<\/div><div>2. The concept \"book magazine\" means \"A magazine about books\", and not \"A magazine the size of a book\".<\/div><div>3. The concept \"ice sand\" means \"Sand that has ice in it\", and not \"Sand that is cold\".<\/div><\/div><div>&nbsp;<\/div><div><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: transparent;\">Additionally, you will rate how familiar you are with the phrase you just interpreted, and<\/span><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> how easy it was for you to come up with your interpretation.<\/span><\/div><div><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br><\/span><\/div><div><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Example: If you were given the prompt, \"What does 'ballerina dancer' mean?\", you would type something like \"a dancer who dances ballet\". This is a very familiar phrase, so you would click \"<\/span><span style=\"font-size: 14.66670036315918px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">extremely familiar\" and perhaps very easy to think of, so you would click \"extremely easy\".<\/span><\/div><\/div><div><span style=\"font-size: 14.66670036315918px; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br><\/span><\/div><div><span style=\"font-size: 14.66670036315918px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">We will begin with a short practice, together with the experimenter<\/span><\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q604","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"You will be presented, one at a time, with 35 noun-noun phrases which you may or may not have see...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID601","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"NextChoiceId":1,"NextAnswerId":1}},{"SurveyID":"SV_1U30Tu75n416PxI","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID614","SecondaryAttribute":"You may now take a short break. To continue with the study, please click on the grey arrow below.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"You may now take a short break. To continue with the study, please click on the grey arrow below.","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q615","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"You may now take a short break. To continue with the study, please click on the grey arrow below.","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID614"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_1U30Tu75n416PxI","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID615","SecondaryAttribute":"In this task you will be presented, one at a time, with a color word (e.g., \"brown\"). This word c...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"In this task you will be presented, one at a time, with a color word (e.g., \"brown\"). This word can either be in the color referred to by the word (the word \"brown\" appearing in brown) or not (the word \"brown\" appearing in orange).<div><br><\/div><div>you are required to choose, as quickly as possible, the COLOR of the word that it appears in. Once you make a decision you will immediately be presented with the following word<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>press \"continue\" to begin<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q617","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"In this task you will be presented, one at a time, with a color word (e.g., \"brown\"). This word c...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID615"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_1U30Tu75n416PxI","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID616","SecondaryAttribute":"+","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size:37px;\">+<\/span><\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q619","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"+","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID616"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_1U30Tu75n416PxI","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID617","SecondaryAttribute":"Timing","