ith as many original and creative questions for object...","QuestionID":"QID784","QuestionText":"<div>For this task, you'll be asked to come up with as many original and creative questions for objects as you can. The goal is to come up with *creative questions*, which are questions that strike people as clever, unusual, interesting, uncommon, humorous, innovative, or different.<\/div><div>&nbsp;<\/div><div>You will be asked to type questions for 2 different objects.&nbsp;<\/div><div>&nbsp;<\/div><div>You will have 2 minutes to type as many creative questions for each object as you can -- just press TAB after each one.<\/div><div>&nbsp;<\/div><div>Press the arrow to begin.<\/div>","QuestionText_Unsafe":"<div>For this task, you'll be asked to come up with as many original and creative questions for objects as you can. The goal is to come up with *creative questions*, which are questions that strike people as clever, unusual, interesting, uncommon, humorous, innovative, or different.<\/div><div>&nbsp;<\/div><div>You will be asked to type questions for 3 different objects.&nbsp;<\/div><div>&nbsp;<\/div><div>You will have 2 minutes to type as many creative questions for each object as you can -- just press TAB after each one.<\/div><div>&nbsp;<\/div><div>Press the arrow to begin.<\/div>","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_1U30Tu75n416PxI","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID785","SecondaryAttribute":"Timing","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"Choices":{"1":{"Display":"First Click"},"2":{"Display":"Last Click"},"3":{"Display":"Page Submit"},"4":{"Display":"Click Count"}},"Configuration":{"MaxSeconds":"0","MinSeconds":"0","QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"DataExportTag":"Q253","DefaultChoices":false,"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextAnswerId":1,"NextChoiceId":16,"QuestionDescription":"Timing","QuestionID":"QID785","QuestionText":"Timing","QuestionText_Unsafe":"Timing","QuestionType":"Timing","Selector